- Charaka Samhita (English translation) — archive.org
- Sushruta Samhita (English translation) — archive.org  
- Ashtanga Hridayam (English translation) — archive.org
- API (Ayurvedic Pharmacopoeia of India) volumes — ayush.gov.in (free download)
- AYUSH clinical guidelines — ayush.gov.in
- WHO monographs on selected medicinal plants — apps.who.int

### How to add:
1. Download PDFs from the above sources
2. Place .pdf files in this directory (ai-service/rag/documents/)
3. Run: python -m rag.ingest
4. Only new files are processed; existing chunks are skipped

The API of India volumes alone will add thousands of plant monographs with
standardized quality, dosage, and safety data. This is the single highest-value
document set to add.
